@baseUrl = https://license.example.invalid
@organizationId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@snapshotId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@token = replace-with-delegated-api-token

### Saved observations only; ViewInventory + ViewFindings and exact binding required.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/entitlement-evidence?provider=Aws&accountId=123456789012
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Saved selected observation; missing/foreign snapshot returns 404 within an authorized binding.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/entitlement-evidence/{{snapshotId}}?provider=Aws&accountId=123456789012
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Upload collected documents after client CLI connection and explicit Desktop consent.
# Requires ManagePolicies + ViewInventory + ViewFindings and exact binding.
# Replace dates with actual collection timestamps (duration <= 5 minutes, not future dates).
# Source digest is an example, not cloud attestation. No effective authorization is asserted.
# Identical replay is safe; a different payload under this snapshot ID returns 409.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/entitlement-evidence
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "snapshotId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "provider": 1,
  "accountId": "123456789012",
  "startedAtUtc": "2026-11-08T12:00:00Z",
  "collectedAtUtc": "2026-11-08T12:01:00Z",
  "grants": [
    {
      "principal": "arn:aws:iam::123456789012:user/example",
      "sourcePrincipal": "arn:aws:iam::123456789012:user/example",
      "role": "arn:aws:iam::123456789012:user/example",
      "sourceId": "arn:aws:iam::123456789012:policy/example",
      "sourceVersion": "v1",
      "sourceSha256": "AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA",
      "statementId": "Read",
      "scope": "arn:aws:iam::123456789012:root",
      "action": "s3:GetObject",
      "resourcePattern": "arn:aws:s3:::client-bucket/object",
      "effect": "Allow",
      "isExclusion": false,
      "hasCondition": false,
      "isDataAction": false
    }
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Partial identity-policy document evidence only; historical validity and effective authorization are not established."
  ]
}

### Malformed document returns safe 400; oversized bodies return 413.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/entitlement-evidence
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "snapshotId": "not-a-guid" }
